lue":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-02T04:16:28-08:00","id":357384,"title":"","content":"This is very exciting. I have been running Scarred Lands using various systems like D&amp;D 3.0, D&amp;D 3.5, D&amp;D 4.0 (yuck!), Pathfinder, RuneQuest II and Flow. However, I like Pathfinder the most out of all those systems. Not only is it a good system, but I really like the way Paizo does business with their digital-PDF books and other customer friendly business practices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T11:21:29-08:00","id":361470,"title":"","content":"Is there going to be a kickstarter for this or anything? Anything to get a ball rolling on this sooner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4336-crinosg","name":"CrinosG","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T17:54:17-08:00","id":381465,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in updates for this as well. Hope the Scarred lands Pathfinder would be OGL","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4830-the-livewire","name":"The Livewire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T07:37:48-07:00","id":485400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Livewire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/316291-scarred-lands-for-pathfinder?p=381465#post381465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be interested in updates for this as well. Hope the Scarred lands Pathfinder would be OGL</div> </div> </div> </div>It would have to be published under the OGL, if it was published for Pathfinder RPG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>David &quot;Big Mac&quot; Shepheard<br /> <i>Scarnspace is no longer the crystal sphere it once was. The celestial bodies bear horrible scars where gods felled titans. Many of the monstrous races that were created by the titans and gods during the war still survive in the gouged reaches of wildspace.</i><br /> You can see more of me at the <a href=\"http://www.thepiazza.org.uk/bb/viewforum.php?f=67\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands forum at The Piazza</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5736-big-mac","name":"Big Mac","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5736_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T19:03:54-08:00","id":797136,"title":"","content":"So, any news on republication or new materials related to the Scarred Lands setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T04:01:32-08:00","id":797268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/316291-scarred-lands-for-pathfinder?p=797136#post797136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, any news on republication or new materials related to the Scarred Lands setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>According to this last Monday's Monday Meeting Notes:<br /> <br /> Dagger of Spiragos and Ring of Spiragos are in their first draft phase<br /> Scarred Lands Player's Guide: Ghelspad is in post-editing development while art finals are rolling in (assuming I am reading correctly)<br /> <br /> That's all the info I know of so far, but I've not been paying super close attention.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Not so noble anymore.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1823-drake","name":"Drake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1823_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"456"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T12:13:30-08:00","id":797451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drake</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/316291-scarred-lands-for-pathfinder?p=797268#post797268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">According to this last Monday's Monday Meeting Notes:<br /> <br /> Dagger of Spiragos and Ring of Spiragos are in their first draft phase<br /> Scarred Lands Player's Guide: Ghelspad is in post-editing development while art finals are rolling in (assuming I am reading correctly)<br /> <br /> That's all the info I know of so far, but I've not been paying super close attention.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that's some pretty positive developments at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}